### Kevalon ERP — Module 9: Customer Payments
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/payment
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@companyId = REPLACE_WITH_COMPANY_ID
@financialYearId = REPLACE_WITH_FINANCIAL_YEAR_ID
@customerId = REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID
@bankAccountId = REPLACE_WITH_BANK_ACCOUNT_ID
@invoiceId = REPLACE_WITH_INVOICE_ID
@paymentId = REPLACE_WITH_PAYMENT_ID

### Receive a customer payment (strict allocation: allocations total must equal totalAmount)
POST {{baseUrl}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "financialYearId": "{{financialYearId}}",
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "paymentDate": "2026-04-15",
  "mode": "BANK_TRANSFER",
  "bankAccountId": "{{bankAccountId}}",
  "reference": "UTR-20260415-001",
  "totalAmount": 1000,
  "allocations": [
    { "invoiceId": "{{invoiceId}}", "allocatedAmount": 1000 }
  ],
  "notes": "Payment received against invoice"
}

### List payments for a company
GET {{baseUrl}}?companyId={{companyId}}&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get one payment
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{paymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
